11580","kind":"announcement","title":"Geareo Early Access Launch Date Revealed!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that Geareo will launch into Early Access on December 10, 2026!Our announcement trailer is here, marking the next big milestone in Geareo’s development.Build machines, connect circuits, experiment with physics, and bring your engineering ideas to life. From complex mechanical systems to completely unexpected creations, we can’t wait to see what you’ll build.We couldn’t have made it this far without your support, feedback, and incredible creations. Thank you for being pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:11:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687803","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1846651706674455","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"announcement","title":"GEAREO IS COMING TO STEAM NEXT FEST!","summary":"Join us for Steam Next Fest, October 19–26!We’re bringing new features and improvements to Geareo, giving you even more ways to build, experiment, and engineer your own machines.Try the demo, explore what’s new, and see what you can create.See you at Steam Next Fest!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:26:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1842846814443305","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"announcement","title":"30,000 WISHLISTS","summary":"Honestly, that’s pretty incredible. Thank you to everyone who has been following the game, playing the demo, sharing feedback, or simply adding it to your wishlist.We’re working hard to make Geareo worth the wait, and we can’t wait to show you what’s next.If you want to keep following the adventure and be part of the community, come join us on Discord:Join the Geareo DiscordThank you for being part of this adventure.We’ll be sharing more news soon, so stay tuned!30,000 wishlists. We’re just gett","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T13:28:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443305","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1841579228662668","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"update","title":"Steampunk Update","summary":"Steampunk and Pneumatics Are Here!Update 0.8.0The Steampunk Update brings pneumatic simulation to the demo! Build steam-powered systems with pressure, pipes, pistons, valves, and more.What's new:Steampunk UpdatePneumatic simulationBoiler part for generating and storing pressurePipe part for connecting steam bodiesPiston part for converting pressure differences into physical forceGauge part for monitoring pressureValve part for controlling steam flowRegulator part for limiting maximum pressureFix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T13:52:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1840310314347482","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Workshop Now Available in the Demo!","summary":"Update 0.7.0The biggest addition is Steam Workshop support for the demo. You can now upload your creations, browse community creations, and download them directly through Steam Workshop.What's new in 0.7.0:Steam Workshop supportPart Existence modes and Ghost BodiesSmaller Logic part sizesLabel selection and renaming in CircuitsIncreased Stone material frictionHave fun creating and sharing your builds!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T13:39:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1837955055363352","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"announcement","title":"Geareo Roadmap","summary":"Geareo Roadmap This roadmap outlines the current development plan for Geareo. It is intended to give an overview of the features and updates planned for the game. The roadmap is not final and may change as development progresses.Features may be added, removed, delayed, or reprioritized based on testing, player feedback, and technical considerations.https://www.tldraw.com/f/xhoB3zKWUbb45gHdCbep8?d=v-81.-855.2197.1273.page","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T12:44:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055363352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4411580-1836506165576096","game_id":"steam-4411580","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.5.0","summary":"Changes:Added the new Circuit part with a built-in editor and simulatorAdded Worm Gear partAdded Button partAdded Ring Bearing partAdded Glass material with transparency and zero frictionAdded editable keyboard shortcutsAdded Limitless mode, allowing fields and sliders to go far beyond their normal limitsSprings now use a 3D mesh instead of a line renderer for improved visualsIncreased spring strength for more realistic behaviorAdded custom mirror axis selection (X, Y, or Z)Added pagination to t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T14:34:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/ext